- * equivalent trampoline into every process instead of a full vDSO (vDSO time
- * functions would have to be syscalls anyway).
+ * Both are mapped at the top of every process: the vvar page (read only) at
+ * task_size - 2 pages, the vDSO at task_size - 1 page. The vDSO reads the
